    {
      "id": "header",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -310,
      "width": 1650,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "# MDSE original-rule trace: provenance, allocation, verification\n\n**Rule to requirement**: `sourceRule` metadata preserved from original governance reference (NOT a native SysML relationship). **Requirement to tool**: SysML v2 `allocate` via typed usages in [[50_Architecture/MDSE Toolset Composition]]. **Verification case to requirement**: SysML v2 `verify` in a case objective. No `satisfy` assertion or executed test evidence is implied. The fourth row is an earlier pilot requirement with no one-to-one governing rule assigned."
    },
    {
      "id": "gap",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 950,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "**Model coverage boundary**\n\nOnly four specifically modeled allocations and four objectives are shown. Other candidate requirements in `72_Derived_Requirements` are still draft and have not been wholesale promoted. Original rule texts remain normative in `MDSE_v2/governance/RULESET.md`."
    }
